        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 22,
            "printedPage": 14
          }
        ],
        "text": "(There is a knock at the door. Pandiyan opens it; Punyakodi comes inside.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 22,
            "printedPage": 14
          }
        ],
        "text": "Father, where had you gone?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 22,
            "printedPage": 14
          }
        ],
        "text": "It was all for a good matter.",
        "notes": [
          "The corrected Tamil speaker label is exactly `புண்யகோடி`."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u004",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 22,
            "printedPage": 14
          }
        ],
        "text": "(He comes inside and sits down.)",
        "notes": [
          "The source typography around this action is irregular; it is retained as the historical scene-linked action rather than silently merged into new dialogue text."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 22,
            "printedPage": 14
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why didn't you come to the play, father? The play was really excellent.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 22,
            "printedPage": 14
          }
        ],
        "text": "I heard.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "Who told you, father?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "All our mill workers had come, hadn't they? They told me!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "The mill workers were able to come. The foreman couldn't come, could he, father?",
        "notes": [
          "The corrected source reads `மேஸ்திரி`, meaning the mill foreman. The historical English's `superior officer` came from stale source wording and has been replaced."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "Don't be angry! I too had gone all the way to town on a matter concerning you......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "What matter, father!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "I have arranged your marriage.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why marriage for me now? Let me first get some steady job......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "The work you have is enough! A writer's work is steady work, isn't it? Look here, son! It is a very good match...and the girl is very beautiful! Don't refuse—marry her...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "Shouldn't I see the girl, father?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "I know all about you! That is why I brought the photograph.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u017",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "(He searches the pocket of his coat.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "What is this—does he eat one pocket with every wash? (He takes out the photograph and gives it.)",
        "notes": [
          "This spoken line has no explicit source speaker label. It remains direct scene-linked dialogue with `speaker_label: null`; no dialogue-record ID or speaker is invented.",
          "The complaint about a pocket being `eaten` at each wash is translated literally rather than assigning an unstated speaker or laundry subject."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u019",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d015",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "Well, what do you say?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u020",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d016",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "As you wish.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u021",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d017",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 23,
            "printedPage": 15
          }
        ],
        "text": "That's the way to say it, my king! Tomorrow itself I will go to the mill owner and ask for a little money for the wedding. (Angrily) As if he is going to give it. Miser.",
        "notes": [
          "The source closes with the separate insult `கஞ்சன்.`; it was omitted from the historical English and is restored here."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u022",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d018",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 24,
            "printedPage": 16
          }
        ],
        "text": "I have money myself, father!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u023",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s015-d019",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 24,
            "printedPage": 16
          }
        ],
        "text": "Then we can hold the wedding soon.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s015-u024",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 24,
            "printedPage": 16
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Pandiyan smiles.)",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
